  "description": "Find the number of ways to get the target sum using n dice, each with k faces.",
  "target": 6,
  "pseudocode": "let dp = Array(n + 1).fill().map(() => Array(target + 1).fill(0));\ndp[0][0] = 1;\nfor (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n  for (let j = 1; j <= target; j++) {\n    for (let face = 1; face <= k; face++) {\n      if (j - face >= 0) dp[i][j] += dp[i - 1][j - face];\n    }\n  }\n}",
